1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,285
They said Calder Hall was empty after sunset.

2
00:00:04,285 --> 00:00:08,571
That the old humanities wing had been sealed for years, after a fire no one at the college liked to mention.

3
00:00:08,571 --> 00:00:12,857
But one classroom still glowed at night.

4
00:00:12,857 --> 00:00:17,142
Rows of desks sat untouched beneath a veil of dust.

5
00:00:17,142 --> 00:00:21,428
A projector clicked by itself, throwing pale light across a blackboard scarred with old equations and heat stains.

6
00:00:21,428 --> 00:00:25,714
At the front of the room, a paper attendance sheet rested on the lectern...

7
00:00:25,714 --> 00:00:30,000
fresh ink shining beside names no one had spoken in decades.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,285
A student entered, drawn by the light, whispering that he only needed a quiet place to study.

9
00:00:34,285 --> 00:00:38,571
The door closed behind him.

10
00:00:38,571 --> 00:00:42,857
On the board, chalk began to move with a dry, insect-like scrape.

11
00:00:42,857 --> 00:00:47,142
Present.

12
00:00:47,142 --> 00:00:51,428
One by one, the empty desks answered.

13
00:00:51,428 --> 00:00:55,714
Wood creaked.

14
00:00:55,714 --> 00:01:00,000
Chairs shifted.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,285
Damp footprints appeared in the aisle, leading in from nowhere.

16
00:01:04,285 --> 00:01:08,571
The air thickened with the smell of burned paper and wet hair.

17
00:01:08,571 --> 00:01:12,857
Then the projector changed.

18
00:01:12,857 --> 00:01:17,142
No lesson.

19
00:01:17,142 --> 00:01:21,428
No slides.

20
00:01:21,428 --> 00:01:25,714
Only an old class photograph, faces blurred by smoke...

21
00:01:25,714 --> 00:01:30,000
except for one empty seat in the back row.

22
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,285
The attendance sheet lifted in a windless room and turned toward him.

23
00:01:34,285 --> 00:01:38,571
A final line wrote itself beneath the dead.

24
00:01:38,571 --> 00:01:42,857
His name.

25
00:01:42,857 --> 00:01:47,142
By morning, the classroom was dark again.

26
00:01:47,142 --> 00:01:51,428
Thirty desks.

27
00:01:51,428 --> 00:01:55,714
Thirty students.

28
00:01:55,714 --> 00:02:00,000
And in the back row, at last, no seat was empty.
